# Privacy Policy

Effective date: 2026-06-12

Snapy Forge is designed to process user-selected media locally on the Android device.

## What The App Accesses

Snapy Forge may access:

- Videos selected by the user
- Reference images selected by the user
- Output folders selected by the user

The app accesses these files only after the user chooses them through Android's file picker or folder picker.

## Local Processing

Video frame extraction and face matching are processed locally on the device.

Snapy Forge does not upload videos, images, extracted frames, face reference images, or folder data to any server.

## Data Collection

Snapy Forge does not currently include:

- Account login
- Analytics
- Advertising SDKs
- Cloud processing
- Remote tracking

## Exported Files

Users choose where exported frames are saved. Exported files remain in the selected folder on the user's device.

## Contact

For questions, contact the app publisher/developer.

